// swag type overrides, read by `make swagger`.
//
// json.RawMessage is a []byte, which swag describes as []integer:
// without this, every descriptor (xFormat, part ui, type layout),
// every raw record and every records array reaches generated clients
// as number[]. A per-field swaggertype:"array,object" is not an
// alternative — it segfaults swag v2 rc5 on []RawMessage.
//
// The per-path PATCH `set` maps carry swaggertype:"object" instead,
// which wins over this: their values are whatever the path takes — a
// string, a bool, an object — so a map-of-object would reject a legal
// scalar leaf.
replace json.RawMessage map[string]interface{}
